<h1 style="font-size:22px; margin:16px 0 8px;">Your sign-in code</h1>

<p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4f535a;">
  Enter this code in the app to sign in. It expires in <%= @expires_in_minutes %> minutes.
</p>

<p style="font-size:32px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:8px; margin:20px 0; color:#101217;">
  <%= @code %>
</p>

<p class="muted">
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — no one can access your
  account without this code.
</p>
